346 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 54 0 R
/T (A flat list of \(train, station, arrival, departure, days\) tuples scanned for each query costs O\(S\) per query. A station index costs O\(k\) to inspect the k trains at that station \(plus sorting O\(k log k\) if ordered output is needed\). The nested timetable and index use O\(S\) total storage; the index adds O\(S\) references/entries. A flat list is simpler but slower for repeated station queries.)
/E (A flat list of \(train, station, arrival, departure, days\) tuples scanned for each query costs O\(S\) per query. A station index costs O\(k\) to inspect the k trains at that station \(plus sorting O\(k log k\) if ordered output is needed\). The nested timetable and index use O\(S\) total storage; the index adds O\(S\) references/entries. A flat list is simpler but slower for repeated station queries.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
