<<
/Title (Identity rule: records are treated as the same person when they share a normalised phone number. A matching name alone is not enough because different people can share a name. Measurable requirements: normalise phone digits consistently; merge duplicate numbers; preserve all non-empty emails and names; handle missing fields; produce one output record per normalised phone key.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 497 0 R
/Prev 558 0 R
>>
