728 0 obj
<<
/Title (For 100,000 complaints per day, deploy a dictionary loop or collections.Counter. Both use hash-based counting and are O\(n\) average. Counter is concise and optimised for frequency counting; a custom dictionary is useful when additional filtering or grouping rules are required. Normalise case and strip punctuation; empty text should produce an empty dictionary.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 687 0 R
>>
endobj
729 0 obj
<<
/Title (Expected output:)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 688 0 R
>>
endobj
730 0 obj
<<
/Title (2. Rewrite with set methods)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 621 0 R
/Prev 688 0 R
